    "review_burden_at_full_recall": "Smallest summed per-case shortlist prefixes containing every known relevant variant. Null if any relevant variant is absent.",
    "recall_constraint_met": "Whether Recall@3 is at least the frozen V0 Recall@3 threshold.",
    "shortlist_precision": "Micro-averaged precision over the actual shortlist: total evaluator-labeled relevant returned variants divided by total returned variants. Unlike Precision@K, this has no fixed-K denominator.",
